**I am an independent UK SEO consultant. I help recruitment agencies and in-house talent teams get jobs indexed, rank for sector and location searches and win employer enquiries.
 The usual starting point is a £495 fixed technical SEO audit. A monthly retainer can follow. Start with a free 20-minute SEO diagnosis.**

Recruitment sites have two audiences and one fast-moving inventory. Candidates search for jobs. Employers search for a firm that can fill roles. Jobs open and close every week. Indexing problems build up quickly when the site is not set up for them.

