## Frequently asked questions

### How long does it take for recruitment agencies to see SEO results?

Indexing fixes can show within weeks of being deployed. Rankings for sector and location pages usually take several months.

My guide on [how long SEO takes](/blog/how-long-does-seo-take/) explains why.

### How much does AEO cost for a recruitment agency?

The AI visibility audit costs £1,500 fixed. Any ongoing work after the audit is scoped separately.

The [SEO retainer](/services/seo-retainer/) starts at £1,500 per month.

### Do you work with in-house talent teams?

Yes. Careers sites face the same job-page and indexing issues. The audit works the same way.

